# 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€ Database (SQLite single-file, zero external deps) 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€
# Resolved relative to prisma/schema.prisma → actual file: prisma/data/navsite.db.
# Set an absolute path when mounting a volume (e.g. file:/app/data/navsite.db in Docker).
# connection_limit=1: SQLite single-writer model, avoids SQLITE_BUSY on concurrent writes
DATABASE_URL="file:./data/navsite.db?connection_limit=1"

# If this var is missing at first deploy, the setup wizard step 2 guides data directory selection and auto-writes .env;
# If already injected by platform (starts with file:), wizard only probes connectivity.

# 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€ Auth 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€
# JWT signing key, min 32 bytes of random. Empty triggers auto-generation in setup wizard.
# Manual: openssl rand -base64 48
AUTH_SECRET=""

# Access / refresh token TTL (seconds), safe to leave as-is
AUTH_ACCESS_TTL="900"
AUTH_REFRESH_TTL="1209600"

# 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€ App 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Salt for IP deduplication in click analytics (empty auto-derived from AUTH_SECRET via HMAC)
ANALYTICS_SALT=""

# Rate-limit backend: memory (default, single-instance LRU) or db (writes to rate_limit_buckets table)
# Multi-instance deployments MUST use db for cross-instance sharing.
RATE_LIMIT_DRIVER="db"

# Trust proxy-injected X-Forwarded-For / X-Real-IP headers.
# false (default): ignore forged headers (secure default for direct exposure), all clients share direct key;
# true: use rightmost XFF hop 鈥?only valid when traffic genuinely traverses a trusted reverse proxy
#        that overwrites the header (see docker/nginx.conf).
TRUST_PROXY="false"

# Upload directory (relative to project root; must be inside public/ to serve via /uploads/<filename)
UPLOAD_DIR="./public/uploads"

# Backup snapshot directory (root ./data — the DATABASE one lives at prisma/data; must NOT be under public/, runtime guard rejects startup to prevent
# backup JSON from being served over HTTP)
BACKUP_DIR="./data/backups"

# 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€ Kun 1.0 Security Engine (application-layer second line of defense) 鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€鈹€
# off=disabled / log=observe-only, log and don't block (default; switch to block after confirming no false positives)
SECURITY_ENGINE_MODE="log"
# Global QPS threshold: exceeding it triggers anti-attack mode (JS challenge) for 120 seconds
UNDER_ATTACK_QPS="600"
# Challenge bypass TTL (seconds); PoW difficulty and window thresholds are in src/lib/security/engine/rules.ts
CHALLENGE_TTL="600"
